</jpcrp_cor:CareerSummaryInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:TermOfOfficeInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E34712-000SaiMasumiMember">（注）３</jpcrp_cor:TermOfOfficeInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:OfficialTitleOrPositionInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E34712-000IkutaMiyakoMember">

取締役


（監査等委員）

</jpcrp_cor:OfficialTitleOrPositionInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E34712-000IkutaMiyakoMember">生田 美弥子</jpcrp_cor:NameInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:DateOfBirthInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E34712-000IkutaMiyakoMember">1966-08-04</jpcrp_cor:DateOfBirthInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:CareerSummaryInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E34712-000IkutaMiyakoMember">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 65px; line-height: 15px; margin-right: 3px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -60px"&gt;
